& [ImplementedCorrespondence]
  + the scanner validates the closed query and canonical derived-catalogue rebuild against the same admitted SemanticFabric before discovery
  + only exact identity exact compiled label declared applicability and allowed typed relations are admitted channels
  + each candidate retains exact SemanticAddress contribution bases channel-local values evidence conditions unresolved guards and disposition
  + lifecycle package read scope instruction capability kind perspective purpose structured context boundary and protected identity gates precede applicability and relation expansion
  + absent structured applicability or boundary facts become explicit omissions or unresolved guards and never inferred permission or mismatch
  + typed relation walks preserve seed relation identities endpoint direction hop count cycle exclusion depth and path bounds
  + PriorityLattice orders exact identity before exact label before applicability before relation and preserves winning-tier ties as ambiguity
  + discovery itself is capped by page and continuation capacity before output pagination
  + result pages exact-resolve record and source identities and bind request catalogue fabric decisions omissions cursor and digest
  + byte clipping removes only complete tail candidates and refuses an empty non-progressing page
  + cursors commit profile catalogue root fabric root input digest offset and ordinal and canonical validation reruns the entire result

